{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dragon Dinner, you play as a tiny dragon waiter working in a busy fantasy restaurant where every day is full of orders, spills, and sizzling plates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Take orders, bring food, and keep your scaly customers happy before their patience burns out! It\u2019s cozy, cute, and just the right amount of chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/805413fa2f0c925805a4bf58f0538155.poster.avif?t=1762633359\" aria-label=\"Gameplay of the waiter working in the restaurant\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/805413fa2f0c925805a4bf58f0538155.webm?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/805413fa2f0c925805a4bf58f0538155.mp4?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve, Upgrade, Repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is a new shift: attend your customers and keep them happy to complete the day. Between shifts, you can choose one of two upgrades to make your next day smoother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move faster, carry more, or boost your kitchen\u2019s speed. Every little improvement helps when the orders start piling up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/e28d2bc3f4c7f8fdc52cb0cb207310a2.poster.avif?t=1762633359\" aria-label=\"Upgrade skills\" width=780 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/e28d2bc3f4c7f8fdc52cb0cb207310a2.webm?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/e28d2bc3f4c7f8fdc52cb0cb207310a2.mp4?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy, move and sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between days, rearrange your restaurant\u2019s layout to find the perfect flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, and move furniture to make your job easier. A good layout can be a determining factor for each day! Customize the layout to your liking and boost performance with decoration furniture as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb4 More patience for customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Bigger tips</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/d0723004d30e4d23b8c14072dce45f10.poster.avif?t=1762633359\" aria-label=\"Show of of buying, selling and moving furniture\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/d0723004d30e4d23b8c14072dce45f10.webm?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/d0723004d30e4d23b8c14072dce45f10.mp4?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each restaurant is a new challenge! Try to serve as many days as you can and reach the target score to unlock new restaurants with unique recipes, layouts, and dragon customers to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all dragons are the same: some are calm and patient, others are always starving and want their food now! You\u2019ll meet shy solo diners, chatty couples, and big hungry groups that test your multitasking skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/c88604adb341623acc1f4daf71e8d8e6.poster.avif?t=1762633359\" aria-label=\"Different types of dragons in line\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/c88604adb341623acc1f4daf71e8d8e6.webm?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/c88604adb341623acc1f4daf71e8d8e6.mp4?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, service gets faster, trickier, and more rewarding. Learn each dragon\u2019s habits, master your tray skills, and keep the flame of good service alive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scope of the game and what to expect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re thinking about buying Dragon Dinner, please keep in mind that this game is made by a solo developer. That means the scope is intentionally small. My goal is to offer you a charming little game that captures the feeling of working a busy shift in a fun and engaging experience,\u00a0 without overcomplicating things. An affordable price for a few hours of entertainment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have feedback, questions, or run into any issues, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out! I\u2019ll do my best to respond quickly and provide support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you enjoyed the game\u2026 letting me know truly makes my day.\u00a0\ud83d\udc9b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4148630?t=1762633359","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4148630?t=1762633359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor