Every little improvement helps when the orders start piling up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/e28d2bc3f4c7f8fdc52cb0cb207310a2.poster.avif?t=1762633359\" aria-label=\"Upgrade skills\" width=780 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/e28d2bc3f4c7f8fdc52cb0cb207310a2.webm?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/e28d2bc3f4c7f8fdc52cb0cb207310a2.mp4?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy, move and sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between days, rearrange your restaurant\u2019s layout to find the perfect flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, and move furniture to make your job easier. A good layout can be a determining factor for each day! Customize the layout to your liking and boost performance with decoration furniture as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb4 More patience for customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Bigger tips</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/d0723004d30e4d23b8c14072dce45f10.poster.avif?t=1762633359\" aria-label=\"Show of of buying, selling and moving furniture\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/d0723004d30e4d23b8c14072dce45f10.webm?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/d0723004d30e4d23b8c14072dce45f10.mp4?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each restaurant is a new challenge! Try to serve as many days as you can and reach the target score to unlock new restaurants with unique recipes, layouts, and dragon customers to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all dragons are the same: some are calm and patient, others are always starving and want their food now! You\u2019ll meet shy solo diners, chatty couples, and big hungry groups that test your multitasking skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/c88604adb341623acc1f4daf71e8d8e6.poster.avif?t=1762633359\" aria-label=\"Different types of dragons in line\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/c88604adb341623acc1f4daf71e8d8e6.webm?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/extras/c88604adb341623acc1f4daf71e8d8e6.mp4?t=1762633359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, service gets faster, trickier, and more rewarding. Learn each dragon\u2019s habits, master your tray skills, and keep the flame of good service alive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scope of the game and what to expect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re thinking about buying Dragon Dinner, please keep in mind that this game is made by a solo developer. That means the scope is intentionally small. My goal is to offer you a charming little game that captures the feeling of working a busy shift in a fun and engaging experience,\u00a0 without overcomplicating things. An affordable price for a few hours of entertainment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have feedback, questions, or run into any issues, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out! I\u2019ll do my best to respond quickly and provide support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you enjoyed the game\u2026 letting me know truly makes my day.\u00a0\ud83d\udc9b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br></p>","developers":["annafabres"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148630/c1d66456085415e934b6452323a725575b8761ec/header.jpg?t=1762633359","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4148630/2123634265/8be0479b0653ad6a3f6914ba0ef4a722fc3757e4/1762632336/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762633358","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4148630/2123634265/8be0479b0653ad6a3f6914ba0ef4a722fc3757e4/1762632336/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762633358","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4148630/2123634265/8be0479b0653ad6a3f6914ba0ef4a722fc3757e4/1762632336/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762633358","id":257228661,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228661/movie480.mp4?t=1762633358","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228661/movie_max.mp4?t=1762633358"},"name":"AnnouncementTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228661/ffa1f55ebddfb6f1424ab205b17ba0f431e147e2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762633358","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228661/movie480.webm?t=1762633358","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257228661/movie_max.webm?t=1762633358"}}],"name":"Dragon Dinner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>O